{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264owqFCcz3I1795775006.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港二手樓價連跌7周，創近3年來最長跌勢。</p><p></p><p>中原城市領先指數最新報157.32點，按周比較跌百分之0.15，是5月初以來低位。今年來樓價升幅已收窄至約百分之9。</p><p></p><p>四區樓價個別發展，港島結束六連跌，九龍也回升百分之0.9。不過新界兩區受壓，齊跌逾百分之1。編制指數的機構表示，美國12月加息機率大增及環球金融市場波動，買家放慢入市步伐，相信年底前指數將155點，重返4月底水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.786951+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:31:25.320361+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:17:18.747803+00:00","content_hash":"1fab30fae4d64c13d7ff8afec6933a037513fdbd2590e1af46d67dc375fae8c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.786951+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}